				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://dahiti.dgfi.tum.de/en/</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">The Database for Hydrological Time Series of Inland Waters (DAHITI) was developed by the Deutsches Geodätisches Forschungsinstitut der Technischen Universität München (DGFI-TUM) in 2013. DAHITI provides water level time series of lakes, reservoirs, rivers, and wetlands derived from multi-mission satellite altimetry for hydrological applications. All water level time series are free available for the user community after a short registration process.</r3d:description>
